      "title": "Global urban growth - Y1870-2100",
      "description": "Data on global urban extent dynamics from 1870 to 2100, using a urban cellular automata (CA) model with consideration of historical trends of urban growth over a long temporal span and the satellite-derived urban extent time series data (1992-2013). Combination of historical hindcasting (1870-1990) using an urban shrink model and projected future (2020-2100) global urban land extent dynamics under the five Shared Socioeconomic Pathways (SSPs). Climate scenarios (as published): \"SSPs\" [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the STAC catalog climate-risk-stac (https://climate-risk-data.github.io/climate-risk-stac/)]",
